  "notes": "Saudi Company for Hardware (SACO) and its subsidiary (ticker 4008, a Saudi Joint Stock Company) audited consolidated financial statements for the year ended 31 December 2025 with FY2024 comparatives, from the full audited PDF in the 'Annual / 2025' cell of the Saudi Exchange company-profile 'Financial Statements' tab (Resources/fsPdf/643_0_2026-03-10...). Auditor: KPMG Professional Services Company; unqualified opinion. The consolidated financial statements were approved by the Board of Directors on 14 Ramadan 1447H (corresponding to 3 March 2026) - Note 37. Amounts are presented in full Saudi Riyals (scale 1) except per-share data. The auditor's report and the primary statements (printed FS pages 6-9) are scanned images in the filed PDF (transcribed from page renders at 2.7x); the notes are digital text. Consolidated group (SACO + one subsidiary); there is **NO non-controlling interest** (net profit and equity are not split), so only total_equity is carried. There are no discontinued operations - the standard pre-tax - zakat bridge applies. **FY2025 recovered from a FY2024 loss** - FY2024 net loss was SAR -14.1m; FY2025 net profit was SAR 45.6m, helped by a SAR 42.2m 'Gain on sale of investment property, net' (the whole investment_property book value of SAR 94.3m was disposed during FY2025) whose SAR 140.4m cash proceeds were used to repay all bank borrowings - so the Group is now debt-free apart from IFRS 16 lease liabilities. intangible_assets is 'Intangible assets and goodwill'; investment_property_value is carried for FY2024 only (nil FY2025 after the disposal); short_term_investments is the current 'Investments at fair value through other comprehensive income held for sale' (an AIH shareholding); related_party_receivables is 'Due from a related party'; accounts_receivable is 'Accounts receivable'; prepayments is 'Prepayments and other receivables'. other_reserves is the 'Fair value reserve'; treasury_shares is the negative 'Treasury shares' line; defined_benefit_obligation is 'Employees' end of service benefit obligation'; long_term_debt / current_debt are the non-current and current portions of 'Borrowings' (nil FY2025 - carried for FY2024 only, where current_debt combines 'Short term borrowings' and 'Current portion of long-term borrowings'); accounts_payable is 'Accounts and notes payable'; accrued_expenses is 'Accrued expenses and other liabilities'; other_current_liabilities is 'Dividends payable'; lease_liabilities_noncurrent / lease_liabilities_current are the reported lease-liability portions. On the P&L: operating_income is 'Operating income'; impairment_charges is 'Expected credit losses' (a reversal - positive - in FY2025); other_income is 'Other income'; other_nonoperating_income is 'Gain on sale of investment property, net' (FY2025 only); finance_costs is 'Finance cost'; income_taxes_and_zakat is the 'Zakat' charge (FY2024's positive ratio of zakat to the pre-tax loss makes the effective-tax bound warn - expected). On the cash-flow statement: depreciation_amortization combines 'Depreciation and amortization' and 'Depreciation of right-of-use assets'; interest_paid is 'Finance cost paid' (the separate 'Interest on lease liabilities paid' of SAR -16.8m is not folded in); zakat_paid is 'Zakat paid'; capex combines 'Purchase for property and equipment' and 'Purchase for intangible assets'; proceeds_asset_sales combines 'Proceeds from disposal of property and equipment' and 'Proceeds from sale of investment property' (SAR 140.4m in FY2025); debt_repaid combines 'Change in short-term borrowings, net' and 'Repayments of long-term borrowings' for FY2025 (both outflows); for FY2024 debt_issued carries the net short-term-borrowing inflow and debt_repaid the long-term repayment; lease_payments is 'Principal amount of lease liabilities paid'; treasury_share_purchases is 'Purchase of treasury shares' (FY2024 only); the cash-flow statement has no FX-on-cash line and its closing balance equals the balance-sheet 'Cash and cash equivalents' line exactly. FY2025: revenue +7.4% to SAR 1.07bn, net profit SAR 45.6m, EPS 1.27 (FY2024 EPS -0.39). Statement page references are the printed FS page numbers: financial position 6, profit or loss and OCI 7, changes in equity 8, cash flows 9.",
